<!DOCTYPE html><html  lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Google Ads integration for AI agents and workflows | StackOS</title><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_t418lv.png"><meta name="twitter:image:src" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_t418lv.png"><meta property="og:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_t418lv.png"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="600"><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="600"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/entry.z7ALz4wj.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/_slug_.CMebKqZb.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/useIntegrationCatalog.wtjwSlpy.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/integrationRoutePolicy.BHfEqrhY.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/LibraryFrame.CD2pOTex.css" crossorigin><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/manrope-latin-variable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" as="fetch" crossorigin="anonymous" href="/library/integrations/google-ads/_payload.json?aa8e47a4-cf64-43ed-8aa2-6473b185d6eb"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/BT73oLzS.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/BlBH4eXS.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/D6cldFGh.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/ik2kKGEl.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CBNv9QJs.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/Dbua9CwJ.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DIYlYVLR.js"><script type="module" src="/_nuxt/BT73oLzS.js" crossorigin></script><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="StackOS Library" href="/feed.xml"><meta name="description" content="Google Ads API provider contract for customers, budgets, campaigns, ad groups, assets, ads, reporting, and conversions. Explore 10 listed Google Ads actions and see how it fits into StackOS workflows."><meta name="theme-color" content="#090b10"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Google Ads integration for AI agents and workflows | StackOS"><meta property="og:description" content="Google Ads API provider contract for customers, budgets, campaigns, ad groups, assets, ads, reporting, and conversions. Explore 10 listed Google Ads actions and see how it fits into StackOS workflows."><meta name="twitter:title" content="Google Ads integration for AI agents and workflows | StackOS"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Google Ads API provider contract for customers, budgets, campaigns, ad groups, assets, ads, reporting, and conversions. Explore 10 listed Google Ads actions and see how it fits into StackOS workflows."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/library/integrations/google-ads/"><meta property="og:url" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/library/integrations/google-ads/"><script type="application/ld+json" data-hid="integration-software">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Google Ads","description":"Google Ads API provider contract for customers, budgets, campaigns, ad groups, assets, ads, reporting, and conversions.","applicationCategory":"Media Buying","url":"https://ads.google.com/home/"}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-hid="integration-faq">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What can the Google Ads integration do in StackOS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The current catalog includes 10 Google Ads actions across Campaign Management, Creative Operations, Media Measurement. The exact actions used depend on the workflow and approval rules."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does StackOS replace Google Ads?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Google Ads remains the tool that performs its part of the job. StackOS organizes the workflow, keeps status and dependencies visible, and calls the tool only when the plan reaches the right approved action."}}]}</script><meta property="og:site_name" content="StackOS"><script id="unhead:payload" type="application/json">{"titleTemplate":"%s | StackOS"}</script></head><body><div id="__nuxt"><!--[--><div id="top" class="site library-site" data-v-76ae88b3 data-v-e230b581><a class="skip-link" href="#main" data-v-e230b581>Skip to content</a><header class="site-header" data-v-e230b581><div class="shell site-header__inner"><a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="StackOS home"><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="36" height="36"><span>StackOS</span><small>Work, organized</small></a><nav class="site-nav site-nav--desktop" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/#why" class="">Why StackOS</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav><details class="mobile-menu"><summary role="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-controls="site-navigation"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav id="site-navigation" class="site-nav site-nav--mobile" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/#why" class="">Why StackOS</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav></details></div></header><div class="library-nav" aria-label="Library sections" data-v-e230b581><div class="shell library-nav__inner" data-v-e230b581><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Workflows</a><a href="/library/agents/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Agents</a><a href="/library/orchestrators/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Orchestrators</a><a href="/library/integrations/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Integrations</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Articles</a></div></div><main id="main" class="library-main" data-v-e230b581><nav class="library-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-v-e230b581 data-v-59391fa3><div class="shell" data-v-59391fa3><ol data-v-59391fa3><!--[--><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Home</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Library</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/library/integrations/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Integrations</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a aria-current="page" href="/library/integrations/google-ads/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active" data-v-59391fa3>Google Ads</a></li><!--]--></ol></div></nav><!--[--><section class="integration-detail-hero" style="--integration-color:#ffbd5c;" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="shell integration-detail-hero__grid" data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><div class="integration-detail-hero__identity" data-v-76ae88b3><span class="integration-mark is-large has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ffbd5c;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-76ae88b3 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/google-ads.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><div data-v-76ae88b3><a href="/library/integrations/plugins/media-buying/" class="" data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Media Buying plugin</span></a><h1 data-v-76ae88b3>Google Ads</h1></div></div><p data-v-76ae88b3>Google Ads API provider contract for customers, budgets, campaigns, ad groups, assets, ads, reporting, and conversions.</p><div class="integration-detail-hero__meta" data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3><strong data-v-76ae88b3>10</strong> listed actions</span><span data-v-76ae88b3><strong data-v-76ae88b3>3</strong> capability groups</span></div></div><aside data-v-76ae88b3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Use Google Ads inside a complete plan.</p><strong data-v-76ae88b3>StackOS keeps the request, status, approvals, and proof connected around every tool action.</strong><div data-v-76ae88b3><!--[--><a href="https://ads.google.com/home/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-76ae88b3>Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-76ae88b3>↗</span></a><a href="https://developers.google.com/google-ads/api/docs/start" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-76ae88b3>Documentation <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-76ae88b3>↗</span></a><a href="https://ads.google.com/aw/apicenter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-76ae88b3>Open console <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-76ae88b3>↗</span></a><!--]--></div></aside></div></section><section class="integration-facts" data-provider-facts="google-ads" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="shell" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><p class="eyebrow" data-v-76ae88b3>Connection facts</p><h2 data-v-76ae88b3>What the Google Ads connector actually exposes.</h2></div><p data-v-76ae88b3>These details come from the current StackOS provider manifest and action catalog. They describe the available connection—not a promise that every workflow will use every action.</p></div><dl class="integration-facts__grid" data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><dt data-v-76ae88b3>Connection method</dt><dd data-v-76ae88b3>OAuth connection</dd></div><div data-v-76ae88b3><dt data-v-76ae88b3>Setup</dt><dd data-v-76ae88b3>Enable Google Ads API and obtain a developer token. Choose OAuth or grant a service account access in Google Ads and enter its JSON key locally. Service accounts do not need a delegated user. Use Manager Account Ref for the login-customer-id header when accessing customers through a manager.</dd></div><div data-v-76ae88b3><dt data-v-76ae88b3>Capability groups</dt><dd data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management, Creative Operations, Media Measurement</dd></div><div data-v-76ae88b3><dt data-v-76ae88b3>Action boundaries</dt><dd data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>2 read actions</span><span data-v-76ae88b3>8 write actions</span><!----><!----><!----></dd></div></dl></div></section><!----><!----><section class="integration-actions" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="shell" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><p class="eyebrow" data-v-76ae88b3>Action catalog</p><h2 data-v-76ae88b3>Actions listed for Google Ads.</h2></div><p data-v-76ae88b3>Actions listed for this integration. Individual descriptions note availability limits. A workflow still decides which actions belong in the job and where approval is required.</p></div><div class="integration-action-tools" data-v-76ae88b3><label for="action-query" data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Search Google Ads actions</span><input id="action-query" value="" type="search" placeholder="Search 10 actions…" autocomplete="off" data-v-76ae88b3></label><div class="integration-action-tools__filters" data-v-76ae88b3><button class="is-active" type="button" data-v-76ae88b3>All <span data-v-76ae88b3>10</span></button><!--[--><button class="" type="button" data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management <span data-v-76ae88b3>6</span></button><button class="" type="button" data-v-76ae88b3>Creative Operations <span data-v-76ae88b3>1</span></button><button class="" type="button" data-v-76ae88b3>Media Measurement <span data-v-76ae88b3>3</span></button><!--]--></div><p data-v-76ae88b3>10 matching actions</p></div><div class="integration-action-grid" data-v-76ae88b3><!--[--><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Create Google Ad Group</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Create a Google Ads ad group from explicit bidding, targeting, and status fields.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Create Google Ad Group Ad</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Create a Google Ads ad group ad from explicit ad content and safe asset refs.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Creative Operations</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Create Google Asset</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Create a Google Ads asset from an explicit provider-native asset object.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Create Google Campaign</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Create a Google Ads campaign from an explicit campaign object and campaign budget ref.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Create Google Campaign Budget</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Create a Google Ads campaign budget from explicit budget fields and safe customer refs.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Media Measurement</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Create Google Conversion Action</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Create a Google Ads conversion action from explicit tracking and attribution fields.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management</span><b class="is-read" data-v-76ae88b3>Reads data</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>List Google Ads Customers</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Read accessible Google Ads customer metadata for the configured credential.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Media Measurement</span><b class="is-read" data-v-76ae88b3>Reads data</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Search Google Ads Report</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Run one Google Ads GAQL search page. Read body.next_page_cursor from the response file and pass it as page_cursor with the same customer_ref and query to continue; no cursor means the final page.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Campaign Management</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Update Google Campaign Budget</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Update a Google Ads campaign budget from explicit budget changes.</p></article><article data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><span data-v-76ae88b3>Media Measurement</span><b class="is-write" data-v-76ae88b3>Can make changes</b></div><h3 data-v-76ae88b3>Upload Google Click Conversions</h3><p data-v-76ae88b3>Upload approved Google Ads click conversions from safe event refs and daemon-side PII handling.</p></article><!--]--></div><!----></div></section><section class="integration-answer" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="detail-body__narrow" data-v-76ae88b3><p class="eyebrow" data-v-76ae88b3>Direct answer</p><h2 data-v-76ae88b3>How does the Google Ads integration work?</h2><p data-v-76ae88b3>People continue using Google Ads as their tool. StackOS adds it to a visible workflow, keeps the work in order, and passes only the approved action to the integration when that stage is ready.</p><ol class="integration-route-flow" style="--route-color:#ffbd5c;" data-integration-route="google-ads" aria-label="How StackOS routes approved work to Google Ads" data-v-76ae88b3 data-v-4eb1f27f><!--[--><li data-v-4eb1f27f><span data-v-4eb1f27f>01</span><strong data-v-4eb1f27f>Your request</strong><small data-v-4eb1f27f>Start in your AI</small></li><li data-v-4eb1f27f><span data-v-4eb1f27f>02</span><strong data-v-4eb1f27f>StackOS plan</strong><small data-v-4eb1f27f>Expands the steps</small></li><li data-v-4eb1f27f><span data-v-4eb1f27f>03</span><strong data-v-4eb1f27f>Google Ads</strong><small data-v-4eb1f27f>Does its bounded part</small></li><li data-v-4eb1f27f><span data-v-4eb1f27f>04</span><strong data-v-4eb1f27f>Checked result</strong><small data-v-4eb1f27f>Keeps the proof</small></li><!--]--></ol></div></section><section class="related-section" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="shell" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-76ae88b3><div data-v-76ae88b3><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-76ae88b3>More from Media Buying</p><h2 data-v-76ae88b3>Related integrations.</h2></div><a href="/library/integrations/plugins/media-buying/" class="" data-v-76ae88b3>See the plugin →</a></div><div class="integration-related-grid" data-v-76ae88b3><!--[--><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ffbd5c;" data-v-76ae88b3 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ffbd5c;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/custom-media-tool.svg" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-480388d2>Media Buying</span></div><a href="/library/integrations/custom-media-tool/" class="integration-card__body" data-v-480388d2><h2 data-v-480388d2>Custom Media Tool</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Placeholder for project-local paid media tooling. Install a project plugin with concrete HTTP connector config before execution.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Campaign Management</span><span data-v-480388d2>Media Measurement</span><!--]--><!----></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/custom-media-tool/" class="" data-v-480388d2>4 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><!----></footer></article><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ffbd5c;" data-v-76ae88b3 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ffbd5c;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/meta-icon.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-480388d2>Media Buying</span></div><a href="/library/integrations/meta-ads/" class="integration-card__body" data-v-480388d2><h2 data-v-480388d2>Meta Ads</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Meta Marketing API provider contract for ad accounts, campaigns, ad sets, ads, creatives, and insights.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Campaign Management</span><span data-v-480388d2>Creative Operations</span><!--]--><span data-v-480388d2>+1</span></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/meta-ads/" class="" data-v-480388d2>15 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/business/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-480388d2> Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>↗</span></a></footer></article><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ffbd5c;" data-v-76ae88b3 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ffbd5c;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/outbrain.svg" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-480388d2>Media Buying</span></div><a href="/library/integrations/outbrain/" class="integration-card__body" data-v-480388d2><h2 data-v-480388d2>Outbrain</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Outbrain Amplify provider contract. OB-TOKEN-V1 generation, storage, expiry checks, and rotation stay daemon-side.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Campaign Management</span><span data-v-480388d2>Creative Operations</span><!--]--><span data-v-480388d2>+1</span></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/outbrain/" class="" data-v-480388d2>9 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><a href="https://www.outbrain.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-480388d2> Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>↗</span></a></footer></article><!--]--></div></div></section><section class="integration-faq" aria-labelledby="integration-faq-title" data-v-76ae88b3><div class="detail-body__narrow" data-v-76ae88b3><p class="eyebrow" data-v-76ae88b3>Common questions</p><h2 id="integration-faq-title" data-v-76ae88b3>Google Ads and StackOS.</h2><!--[--><details data-v-76ae88b3><summary data-v-76ae88b3>What can the Google Ads integration do in StackOS?</summary><p data-v-76ae88b3>The current catalog includes 10 Google Ads actions across Campaign Management, Creative Operations, Media Measurement. The exact actions used depend on the workflow and approval rules.</p></details><details data-v-76ae88b3><summary data-v-76ae88b3>Does StackOS replace Google Ads?</summary><p data-v-76ae88b3>No. Google Ads remains the tool that performs its part of the job. StackOS organizes the workflow, keeps status and dependencies visible, and calls the tool only when the plan reaches the right approved action.</p></details><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></main><footer class="site-footer" data-v-e230b581 data-v-5f58f905><div class="shell site-footer__grid" data-v-5f58f905><a href="/" class="footer-brand" data-v-5f58f905><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>StackOS</strong><span data-v-5f58f905>Keep AI-powered work clear, connected, and moving.</span></div></a><div class="site-footer__links" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Explore</span><a href="/#why" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Why StackOS</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Getting started</a><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Workflows</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Articles</a></div><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Build</span><a href="/#security" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Security</a><a href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac" data-v-5f58f905>Download</a><a href="https://github.com/flowmonkeyio/StackOS" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-v-5f58f905>GitHub ↗</a></div></div><div class="site-footer__status" data-v-5f58f905><span class="status-dot" data-v-5f58f905></span><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>Runs on your Mac</strong><small data-v-5f58f905>Your work. Your apps. Your private logins.</small></div></div></div><div class="shell site-footer__bottom" data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>StackOS · Your AI tool works. StackOS keeps the work organized.</span><span data-v-5f58f905>Runs locally.</span></div></footer></div><!----><!--]--></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{siteUrl:"https://stackos.flowmonkey.io",gaMeasurementId:"G-KPZXCGXGG5",downloadUrl:"https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg",scrip